== Quest Start ==
Talk to Thalik Silenthand in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Thalik Silenthand'
:''Thalik Silenthand says, 'Greetings, Tify.  Do you believe you are a [great rogue]?' ''
You say, 'great rogue'
:''Thalik Silenthand says, 'I will not take your word for it!  You must prove your greatness to one of my apprentices.  Which test do you wish to undertake?  Something practical like [deception], [stealth], or [thievery]?  Or perhaps something a bit harder to pin down, such as [cunning], [silence], or [trickery]?' ''

== Rogue Test of Deception ==

You say, 'deception'
:''Thalik Silenthand says, 'Deception it is.  Proceed upward through the sky and return to me a bixie stinger, bloodsky sapphire, and a wind rune jaka for the test of deception and earn Thornstinger, the dirk of rampage.' ''

'''Reward:''' {{:Thornstinger}}

